### Inscription valide
POST http://localhost:3000/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstname": "Selim",
  "lastname": "Touileb",
  "email": "selim.touileb@hotmail.com",
  "password": "Selim1234"
}


### Connexion utilisateur
POST http://localhost:3000/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "ronaldo@madrid.com",
  "password": "Portugal10"
}

### Connexion admin
POST http://localhost:3000/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@greenroots.fr",
  "password": "Admin123!"
}



### Renouvellement des tokens
POST http://localhost:3000/api/auth/refresh

### Refresh avec token invalide
POST http://127.0.0.1:3000/api/auth/refresh
Cookie: refreshToken=faux-token

### Déconnexion
POST http://localhost:3000/api/auth/logout

### Test route trees protégée - sans connexion
GET http://127.0.0.1:3000/api/trees

### Test route trees protégée - avec connexion
GET http://localhost:3000/api/trees

### Test route trees protégée - token invalide
GET http://127.0.0.1:3000/api/trees
Cookie: accessToken=faux-token